  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">覺得 Avaritia 對你來說太簡單了嗎？想要讓終局製作更具挑戰性嗎？這個模組正是為你而設。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">這個附加模組引入了<strong>覆鱗龍鋼（Plated Dragonsteel）</strong>，這是一種至關重要且難以獲得的材料，現在是開啟你 Avaritia 旅程的必要條件。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">要獲得它，你需要完全通關<strong>冰與火之龍（Ice and Fire）</strong>和<strong><strong>Create</strong></strong>，使通往神器物品的道路變得更加漫長和充滿挑戰。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">此模組需要以下前置模組：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火之龍（Ice and Fire: Dragons）</a> <strong>或</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iceandfire-ce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火之龍 社群版（IceAndFire Community Edition）</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/re-avaritia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Re:Avaritia（理論上 APE 也可以與其他 Avaritia 分支兼容。）</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>你可以在你的整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
